  "final_answer": "I found the answer in the config.json file. The temperature parameter is defined in the `task_specific_params.text-generation` section with a value of **1.0**.\n\n**Key finding from config.json (Line 32):**\n```json\n\"task_specific_params\": {\n    \"text-generation\": {\n        \"do_sample\": true,\n        \"max_length\": 50,\n        \"temperature\": 1.0\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Answer\n\nThe default value of the **temperature** parameter in the GPT-J-6B model's settings is **1.0**.\n\nThis is documented in the model's `config.json` file under the `task_specific_params` → `text-generation` section, alongside other default generation parameters:\n- `do_sample`: true\n- `max_length`: 50\n- `temperature`: 1.0",
